Classify as: \\
\begin{inparaenum}[(i)]
\item Foam colloid
\item Solid foam colloid
\item Aerosol colloid
\item Emulsion colloid
\item Gel colloid
\item Sol colloid
\item Solid-sol colloid
\item A solution
 \end{inparaenum}
\\ the following series of mixtures:\\
\begin{inparaenum}[(a)]	
\item   Mayonnaise	%Emulsion	
\item 		Jelly 	%Gel
\item 		 Butter 	%Gel
\item 		 Curd 	%Gel
\item 		 Cheese	%Gel
\item 		Smoke 	%Aerosol
\item 		 Haze	%Aerosol
 \item		Gold sol 	%Sol
 \item		 Sulphur sol	%Sol
\item 		Colored glasses   	%Solid-sol
\item 		 Gems   	%Solid-sol
\item 		 Ruby glass  	%Solid-sol
 \end{inparaenum}
